</figcaption></figure><p>想催月經「找伴侶疏通」就會來？一票人認證有效　婦科醫揭真相</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.641037+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2907,"images":38,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:30:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:16.717004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:16.717004+00:00","content_hash":"d63630031c59a3689d1a8d17f9eef82ba519696ec18be10a6d7c07c61dd67a2b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}